          "worked": "Balance in dollars:\n$$\\begin{align*}-120+20\\times9&=-120+180\\\\-120+20\\times9&=-120+120+60\\\\-120+20\\times9&=60\\end{align*}$$\nHis bank balance after 20 days is $\\$60$.",
